odotengine/godot/pulls/123047","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/123047","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/123047.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/123047.patch","merged_at":"2026-09-01T18:32:20Z"},"body":"<!--\r\nPlease target the `master` branch. We will take care of backporting relevant fixes to older versions.\r\n\r\nBefore submitting, please read our checklist for contributors:\r\nhttps://contributing.godotengine.org/en/latest/engine/introduction.html#checklist-for-new-contributors\r\n\r\nUse of AI must be disclosed and should include a description of how it was used.\r\n-->\r\n\r\n## What problem(s) does this PR solve?\r\n\r\n- Makes some methods' functionality clearer \r\n\r\n## Additional information\r\n\r\n<!--\r\nProvide additional information and explanation of your PR, including areas that you are uncertain of or require special attention from reviewers. For examples, please read our pull request guidelines: https://contributing.godotengine.org/en/latest/pull_requests/pull_request_guidelines.html#explain-your-contributions\r\n-->\r\n\r\nTo my understanding, the `p_` prefix for parameters is to be used when a parameter informs the behavior of a method; the `r_` prefix should be used when the parameter is a pointer/reference, and the method populates its fields/data so that it can be used elsewhere.\r\n\r\nWhile working on another PR, I needed to use `get_constants(HashMap<StringName, Variant> *p_constants)`. I realized that, according to the naming rules this should instead be `r_constants` since I am meant to pass in an empty HashMap and have it be populated by the method. For the PR fixing this, I ended up going through the rest of the `script_language.h` file to fix all of the instances I could find. Of course, the implementations and subclass override declarations of these methods in other files have also been updated.","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/123047/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/123047/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}